@startuml 4.2.4_activity_diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

|Farmer|
start
:Harvest fresh cardamom capsules;
:Cure and dry in curing chamber;
:Record harvest details (fresh/dry kg, variety, grade);
:Update farmer inventory ledger;
:Post cardamom lot on marketplace;

|Trader|
:Browse marketplace listings;
:Select cardamom lot & specify quantity;
:Submit purchase procurement request;
if (Select Payment Method) then (Online)
    :Pay via Razorpay Gateway;
else (Direct)
    :Choose Direct Cash / Bank Transfer;
endif
:Settle payment to farmer;

|Farmer|
:Verify payment & pack stock;
:Confirm physical stock handover;

|Trader|
:Inspect stock & confirm pickup;
:Receive lot into trader warehouse inventory;
:Receive export supply request from Exporter;
:Fulfill supply request & transfer stock;

|Exporter|
:Register international buyer profile;
:Create export order (Incoterms, USD value, Port);
:Allocate inventory batch from trader;
:Initiate laboratory quality inspection;

|Quality & Compliance|
:Inspect moisture percentage (<= 11%);
:Measure capsule diameter (>= 8mm);
:Evaluate surface color (Deep Green);
if (Quality criteria met?) then (Yes)
    :Issue Quality Approval Certificate;
else (No)
    :Issue Quality Rejection Notice;
    :Re-cure or re-grade lot;
    detach
endif
:Vacuum seal in food-grade packaging;
:Apply tamper-evident batch barcodes;
:Upload Phytosanitary Certificate;
:Upload Certificate of Origin & Invoice;

|Logistics & International Buyer|
:Book ocean freight / air cargo;
:Dispatch consignment from departure port;
:Update shipment tracking number;
:Generate secure 72-hr buyer delivery token;
:Email delivery confirmation link to buyer;
:Cargo arrives at overseas destination port;
:Buyer inspects delivered cardamom consignment;
if (Cargo condition satisfactory?) then (Yes)
    :Submit delivery confirmation (GOOD);
else (Dispute)
    :Raise delivery dispute (DAMAGED/PARTIAL);
    :Submit inspection evidence photo/receipt;
    :Resolve claim with exporter;
endif
:Update export order status to COMPLETED;
:Record financial settlement in transaction ledger;
stop
@enduml